# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not part of the code release
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The written work and its sources live here but are not published with the
# code.  `Articles/` holds the cited papers as PDFs: they are copyrighted by
# their publishers and must not be redistributed from this repository.
Articles/
report/
presentation/
review/
studies/

# The seven modules below exist only to typeset the written report -- they
# draw its figures, crop figures out of the papers in `Articles/`, and know
# its chapter structure.  Nothing in `problems/` or the rest of `tools/`
# imports them.
tools/report_figures.py
tools/theory_figures.py
tools/theory_schematics.py
tools/theory_grid_numbers.py
tools/figures_ladder.py
tools/extract_paper_figures.py
tools/extract_final_figures.py

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
output/
compare-lhat/
*.xdmf
*.h5
*.vtu
*.pvd
*.msh
*.npz
*.mp4
*.gif

# Figures are generated, so they are not tracked -- except the two schematic
# panels `tools/animations.py` needs to draw its 2D specimen, which have no
# generator in this repository.
*.png
*.pdf
!tools/assets/*.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environments, editors, caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
.claude/
.DS_Store

# WSL writes one of these next to every file copied in from Windows.
*:Zone.Identifier
